### Fan-out/fan-in

::code-wrapper{language="go"}
```go
// Fan-out: multiple goroutines read from the same input channel
out := make(chan int)
for i := 0; i < 3; i++ {
    go func(in <-chan int, out chan<- int) {
        for v := range in {
            out <- process(v)
        }
    }(in, out)
}
